    "description_raw": "This spell functions like cure light wounds, except that it cures 3d8 points of damage + 1 point per caster level (maximum +15).Mythic Cure Serious WoundsSource Mythic Adventures pg. 90\nThe damage cured increases to 6d8 points of damage + 2 points per caster level (maximum +30). The spell cures up to 3 points of ability damage if the target is a living creature. The target chooses what types of ability damage are cured.",
